{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"TIT","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"提多书","commonName":"提多书","title":"提多书","order":56,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"e5705f43b4e1797b51a37f17144eb8297b5ae653662435ba9ce15dfaced77ad2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/TIT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/TIT/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":46},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["专心行善"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你要提醒众人顺服执政掌权者，要服从，随时准备做各种善事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["不要毁谤，不要争吵，要谦和、恭敬地对待每一个人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["从前我们也愚蠢、悖逆、易受迷惑，受各种私欲和享乐驱使，心里充满恶念和嫉妒，令人憎恶，也彼此憎恨。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但我们的救主上帝向人彰显了祂的恩慈和仁爱，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["借着重生之洗和圣灵的更新拯救了我们，这并非因为我们有义行，而是因为祂的怜悯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["上帝借着我们的救主耶稣基督把圣灵丰丰富富地浇灌在我们身上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["这样，我们既然靠着祂的恩典被称为义人，就可以成为后嗣，有永生的盼望。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["以上这些话是可信的，希望你认真强调，使信上帝的人专心行善。这都是造福众人的美事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["要避免愚昧的争论、有关家谱的辩驳和律法上的争执，因为这些毫无益处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["对于制造分裂的人，警告过一两次后，要和他断绝来往。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因为你知道这种人已经背道犯罪，自定己罪。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["信末的嘱咐与问候"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我会派亚提马或者推基古去见你。到时候，你要尽快到尼哥波立来见我，因为我决定在那里过冬。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你要为西纳律师和亚波罗送行，尽力帮助他们，让他们路上一无所缺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我们的弟兄姊妹也要学习行善，供应有急需的人，免得毫无建树。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["这里的弟兄姊妹都问候你，也请你问候那些因信仰而爱我们的人。 愿恩典常与你们众人同在！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/TIT/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/PHM/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/TIT/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}